flowchart TD
  DESK[Desktop: submit text request and explicit demo date] --> API[POST /api/cases]
  API --> REQ[W1 extract requirements]
  REQ --> COMPLETE{Required fields complete?}
  COMPLETE -->|No| CAP{Clarification count below limit?}
  CAP -->|No| HUMAN[HUMAN_REVIEW plus persisted audit]
  CAP -->|Yes| Q[Persist clarification request]
  Q --> WAIT_Q[Graph interrupt: wait for REST clarification]
  WAIT_Q -->|POST /clarifications and resume| REQ
  COMPLETE -->|Yes| CAT[Create immutable synthetic package offer snapshots]
  CAT --> AVAILABLE{Any eligible preliminary offers?}
  AVAILABLE -->|No| HUMAN
  AVAILABLE -->|Yes| CMP[W3 deterministic preliminary ranking]
  CMP --> EVD[W2 evaluate evidence for candidate]
  EVD --> MGR[Manager arbitration and audit]
  MGR --> SAFE{All required claims PASS?}
  SAFE -->|No| RETRY{Alternative and rerank budget available?}
  RETRY -->|No| HUMAN
  RETRY -->|Yes| EXCLUDE[Persist exclusion and rerank event]
  EXCLUDE --> NEXT[W3 choose next candidate]
  NEXT --> EVD
  SAFE -->|Yes| FINAL[Publish verified final offer to both browser views]
  FINAL --> PREP[Prepare idempotent PENDING approval in PostgreSQL]
  PREP --> WAIT[Graph interrupt: await customer decision, no side effects]
  WAIT -.-> PHONE[Phone simulator: show offer, price, version and SIMULATION ONLY]
  PHONE -->|Approve or reject via POST decision| APIS[FastAPI: validate nonce and snapshot; commit decision]
  APIS -->|Command resume same thread ID| WAIT
  WAIT --> DECISION{Read durable PostgreSQL approval status}
  DECISION -->|REJECTED| REJECT[REJECTED plus audit; both views refresh]
  DECISION -->|Invalid or stale| HUMAN
  DECISION -->|APPROVED| BOOK[W4 idempotent mock order; read-back]
  BOOK --> CONFIRM{Committed order exists and matches approval?}
  CONFIRM -->|No| HUMAN
  CONFIRM -->|Yes| REVIEW[W5 summary and audit]
  REVIEW --> DONE[Case DEMO_COMPLETED]
  DONE --> BOTH[Dashboard and phone simulator display same backend-confirmed result]
  API -.-> PG[(PostgreSQL business tables)]
  MGR -.-> PG
  BOOK -.-> PG
  REQ -.-> CP[(AsyncPostgresSaver checkpoint tables)]
